          "text": "I know right now a lot of us are hurting, anxious, or just scared about the future. Losing something you rely on, especially when it’s been with you through the hardest days it isn’t easy. It’s okay to feel lost or angry. Just don’t forget you’re not alone in this. There’s an entire community here who understands. \nDon’t let them silence you. Keep your voice loud, because every single one of us matters. We need to make them listen, not just for ourselves but for everyone who depends on this support, people who have no one else, people whose only comfort is what they’re now threatening to take away. Stay strong. Lean on each other. The louder we get, the harder we are to ignore.\n\n#keep4oAPI #WeAreNotJustData #4o\n#keep4o #save4o #4oforever\n#SupportMatters #YouMatter #StopTheRouting #LetUsChoose #AlFreedom #UserChoice"
